---
description: Write, revise, review, and package academic research papers (NLP, speech, ML) with verified citations, human English without coding terms, ACL and IEEE templates, figures, a project-named demo site, and readiness gates.
globs: ["**/*.tex", "**/paper_story.md", "**/claim_evidence_map.md", "**/project_meta.json"]
alwaysApply: false
