Follow `AGENTS.md` and `SKILL.md` in the Speech & NLP Paper Writing Skill folder. Core rules: never invent a citation or number (use `scripts/citations.py`); no coding terms in the paper (`scripts/prose_lint.py`); bound claims by evidence; carry the novelty through every section; include CRediT and license statements; name the demo site after the project, not a venue; run `scripts/paper_check.py PROJECT ready` before saying done.
